1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:07,994
And the two rays are plane polarized, in planes at right angles to each other: one shown with dots, one with arrows.

2
00:00:07,994 --> 00:00:17,500
A Nicol prism is a calcite crystal cut in two and cemented with Canada balsam, so that the ordinary ray is totally internally reflected away.

3
00:00:17,500 --> 00:00:21,289
Only the polarized extraordinary ray comes out.

